  "description": "Raft Pack is a \"Raft\" inspired Modpack that leaves you stranded in the ocean, scavenging for resources.",
  "body": "# RAFT PACK \nRaft Pack is a survival-based modpack that leaves the player stranded in the middle of an ocean with nothing but a raft to survive on.\n\n⭐ Disclaimer, I'm looking for a map maker to possibly create an official RaftPack World!\n\n# **Features**\n- Small Ships\n- Naturalist + Spawn\n- Create\n- Botany Pots + Botany Trees\n- Compost & Early Stage\n- Fabric Seasons\n- Hardcore Revival\n- Hybrid Aquatic\n- Sophisticated Backpacks\n- Ambient Sounds\n- Dehydration\n- Hardcore Revival\n- Mob Varients\n- Custom Made World\n\n⭐ If you enjoyed this modpack, then make sure to check out my other modpack [\"All Of Nature\"](https://modrinth.com/modpack/allofnature)!!",
